# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Pray4Me environment. Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values you need.
#
# MINIMUM to run locally: the two VITE_SUPABASE_* vars below. Everything else is
# OPTIONAL — the app degrades gracefully without it:
#   • No Anthropic key  → AI features stay off (they're consent-gated anyway).
#   • No YouVersion key → the verse reader shows references + a Bible.com link.
#   • No VAPID key      → push reminders are unavailable; in-app reminders still work.
#   • Analytics needs NO key (Vercel auto-injects in prod; a no-op locally).
# See README "Run without optional integrations" for the bare-minimum path.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Client (browser) vars MUST be VITE_-prefixed — Vite only exposes those, and
# anything VITE_-prefixed IS shipped in the JS bundle. Never put a secret here.

# ── Required: Supabase (database, auth, sync) ────────────────────────────────
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your_supabase_url_here.supabase.co/rest/v1/
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=sb_publishable_your_anon_key_here

# ── Private AI backend (pray-for-me-ai) — the DEFAULT AI provider ─────────────
# By default the app's AI (/api/ai) and Spoken Guide (/api/spoken-guide) talk
# ONLY to your OWN private AI + voice backend — never to Anthropic/OpenAI or any
# third-party AI/TTS provider. See the pray-for-me-ai repo for how to run it.
#
# AI_BACKEND_URL / AI_BACKEND_API_KEY are SERVER-ONLY (never VITE_-prefixed, so
# never bundled). The service key must match AI_BACKEND_API_KEY in pray-for-me-ai.
AI_PROVIDER=private
AI_BACKEND_URL=https://ai-api.example.com
AI_BACKEND_API_KEY=replace-with-strong-secret
AI_MODEL=llama3.1:8b
AI_ALLOWED_MODELS=llama3.1:8b,mistral:7b,qwen2.5:7b
# Public (VITE_) model name the browser requests; the server still enforces
# AI_ALLOWED_MODELS. Keep it in sync with a model in the allowlist.
VITE_AI_MODEL=llama3.1:8b

# ── Spoken Prayer Guide (driving-safe voice sessions) ────────────────────────
SPOKEN_GUIDE_ENABLED=true
SPOKEN_GUIDE_MAX_PRAYERS=20
SPOKEN_GUIDE_MAX_CHARS_PER_PRAYER=1000

# ── Optional: giving / donation link (shown in the Donate modal) ─────────────
VITE_DONATION_URL=https://paypal.me/YOUR_PAYPAL_USERNAME

# ── Optional: Web Push — PUBLIC VAPID key only ───────────────────────────────
# Generate with: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
VITE_VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=your_vapid_public_key_here
# ── Optional: in-app verse reader (YouVersion Platform API) ──────────────────
# Set to 'true' to source verse text from the YouVersion Platform API
# (authoritative publisher text). Requires YVP_APP_KEY below. When unset/false,
# the reader shows the REFERENCE with a link to open it in the user's Bible — it
# never generates Scripture text with AI. PUBLIC on/off flag only; the App Key
# itself stays server-side (see below).
VITE_YOUVERSION_ENABLED=false

# ── Server-only secrets — NOT VITE_ prefixed, never bundled ──────────────────
# LEGACY / OPTIONAL: Anthropic is NO LONGER used by default — the app routes all
# AI through the private backend above. The old /api/anthropic proxy is kept only
# for backwards compatibility and is not called by the app. Leave this unset
# unless you deliberately re-enable a third-party provider. There is no
# client-side fallback (never VITE_-prefixed).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# YouVersion Platform App Key — read by the Vite dev proxy (vite.config.js) and
# the /api/youversion serverless function, injected as the X-YVP-App-Key header
# server-side so it's never bundled. Register an app at platform.youversion.com
# to obtain it. Only used when VITE_YOUVERSION_ENABLED=true.
YVP_APP_KEY=your_youversion_app_key_here

# The VAPID PRIVATE key is used only by the Supabase Edge Functions
# (send-daily-reminder, send-follow-up-reminder) and is set via
# `supabase secrets set VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=...`. Never store it here
# or VITE_-prefix it — that would expose it to the browser.

# ── Feature gating ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There is NO active paid feature gating: every feature is available to everyone,
# and there are no plan/billing env vars. Some richer flows (e.g. scheduling) use
# a Simple vs Advanced UI split purely to reduce overload — never to gate
# features. The optional VITE_DONATION_URL above is a voluntary gift only; it
# never unlocks anything. (A future Supporter membership is staged on the
# `feature/supporter-model-staged` branch, not active here.)
# Analytics (Vercel) can be turned off locally by setting localStorage
# `pfm_analytics_off` to '1' (see src/lib/analytics.js).
